---
/**
 * One of the brand's woven cords as a quiet background accent. If it is ever
 * dropped, this component, its use in HomeBody.astro, the "cord" block in
 * site.css and cord-o3-horizontal.svg in public/assets/weave/ go together.
 *
 * Decorative only: aria-hidden, nothing focusable, and no layout of its own.
 * Nothing here takes space, adds a margin or moves the page.
 *
 * A marker of zero height between two sections. The cord hangs from it,
 * absolutely positioned, across the width of the page, entering high on the
 * left and running lower to the right.
 *
 * It sits under the content (z-index -1). Readability over the cord comes from
 * placement and is kept in site.css; see the "cord" block there.
 */
---

<div class="cord cord--band" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="cord__art" />
</div>
